    "switch": {
      "name": {
        "en": "Here I Come!"
      },
      "desc": {
        "en": "Brisshell swings Alfred in wide arc, dealing Earth DMG to nearby enemies. / Using her Switch Skill after triggering her Support Skill enhances the skill, sending Alfred into a frenzy. Alfred charges at the enemy, then swiftly maneuvers, trampling them and dealing Earth DMG. / [Support Skill] When a teammate lands a Basic Attack or Special Skill, Brisshell enters the field, striking Alfred into the ground. She deals Earth DMG to nearby enemies, then inflicts Earth Affliction. / If Brisshell switches out without using her Enhanced Basic Attack while Attention Overload is active, her Enhanced Support Skill is fully charged. / [Enhanced Support Skill] Alfred pursues the enemy, unleashing a series of bites and slashes that deal Earth DMG, then inflicts Earth Affliction. / Brisshell's Enhanced Support Skill isn't affected by her Support Skill Cooldown and can be triggered based on the number of charges. Also, while using the Enhanced Support Skill, Attention Overload remains active regardless of its usual duration."
